{
  "name": "dsh-liubian-twin",
  "version": "0.1.0",
  "description": "流变·孪生（DSH 版）：在同一会话里挂一个监察智能体，用会话自己的模型审执行智能体的每一个动作（工具调用 / 准备输出的话），偏离用户指令时当场拦下并给出可直接执行的纠正。与 dsh-liubian 功能上不互通（不引它的代码与数据），只在命名上归流变系列。",
  "private": true,
  "type": "module",
  "main": "./lib/main.mjs",
  "exports": {
    ".": "./lib/main.mjs"
  },
  "files": [
    "lib/",
    "criteria.json",
    "README.md",
    "LICENSE"
  ],
  "peerDependencies": {
    "@deepseek-ai/dsh-tools": ">=0.0.1-rc <2",
    "cordis": ">=4.0.0-rc <5"
  },
  "keywords": [
    "deepseek-harness",
    "dsh",
    "liubian",
    "twin",
    "supervisor"
  ],
  "license": "MIT",
  "dsh": {
    "bundle": {
      "patch": "./cordis.patch.yml"
    }
  }
}
